<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/catalog#linkset/cosmos_dataset_specialization_to_model_variable>
    a void:Linkset ;
    dcterms:accessRights "Built locally, not published: it starts from or ends at a sign-in source." ;
    dcterms:description "A Dataset Specialization variable row that is not an SDTMIG variable of its domain, to an SDTM Model variable row." ;
    dcterms:title "cosmos dataset specialization to model variable" ;
    dcterms:type "by rule" ;
    void:linkPredicate <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/rule/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#sdtm_variable/sdtm-model/SDTM> ;
    void:objectsTarget <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/graph/sdtm-model> ;
    void:subjectsTarget <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/graph/cosmos> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rule: Only where the row has no link to an SDTMIG variable. The class of the domain is the Class the SDTMIG table gives for that Dataset Name; with it, the rule of \"sdtmig variable to model variable\" (domain as Dataset Name, sdtm_variable as Variable Name). A domain that is not an SDTMIG dataset has no class: only Class General Observations is tried." ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/catalog#linkset/cosmos_dataset_specialization_to_nsv>
    a void:Linkset ;
    dcterms:description "A Dataset Specialization variable row that is neither an SDTMIG nor an SDTM Model variable, to the NSV Registry rows of its name without the domain prefix." ;
    dcterms:title "cosmos dataset specialization to nsv" ;
    dcterms:type "by rule" ;
    void:linkPredicate <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/rule/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#sdtm_variable/nsv-registry/Approved%20NSVs-alpha> ;
    void:objectsTarget <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/graph/nsv-registry> ;
    void:subjectsTarget <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/graph/cosmos> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rule: Only where the row has no link to an SDTMIG or an SDTM Model variable. sdtm_variable with the domain prefix removed (only if it starts with the domain) equals the registry Variable Name as published (no trimming). Every matching registry row is linked (the registry key is Variable Name + Source(s))." ;
.

<https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/catalog#linkset/cosmos_dataset_specialization_to_sdtmig_variable>
    a void:Linkset ;
    dcterms:accessRights "Built locally, not published: it starts from or ends at a sign-in source." ;
    dcterms:description "A Dataset Specialization variable row to the SDTMIG variable row of the same name in its own domain." ;
    dcterms:title "cosmos dataset specialization to sdtmig variable" ;
    dcterms:type "by rule" ;
    void:linkPredicate <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/rule/cosmos/cdisc_sdtm_dataset_specializations_latest#sdtm_variable/sdtmig/SDTMIG> ;
    void:objectsTarget <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/graph/sdtmig> ;
    void:subjectsTarget <https://kerfors.github.io/cdisc-for-all/graph/cosmos> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rule: domain equals the SDTMIG Dataset Name and sdtm_variable equals the SDTMIG Variable Name." ;
.

